<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="3JN" style="id">3YOH ARUM</book>
  <para style="h">3 AYOHANA</para>
  <para style="toc1">3 Ayohana</para>
  <para style="toc2">3 Ayohana</para>
  <para style="toc3">3 Yoh</para>
  <para style="mt2">AMGBASHO ATA ATATOH ANYI NA</para>
  <para style="mt1">AYOHANA</para>
  <para style="imt">IKPI TSIFA</para>
  <para style="im">A bu agba kyangwri mi tana a ŋa Amgbasho Ayohana ata atatoh reh. Tana a ŋa a na agba kyangwri ida Nnoh ata isa a ŋoh nza bu Gayus reh.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="3JN 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="3JN 1:1" />Amgbasho ata areh anyi na amya agba kyangwri ata ida Nnoh a na na iza amya Gayus ata mya nza ni kira a ŋoh ata a zizi reh.<verse eid="3JN 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="3JN 1:2" />Iza amya ata mya nza ni kira meh kwere Nnoh la ti tuma alindeh tasa itoh anzoh za ta tuma alindeh. Tswanza nza ni rya tohmoh nimeh huru reh. <verse eid="3JN 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="3JN 1:3" />Meh nza nana gaga na mgbiri ambohroh mboh amboh tufa amboh anyi ma a ba ba a leh a bleh tsifa ma ikpi biroh a zizi ata ni bu na wohroh reh, tasa la ni kǝ rya tohmoh nimeh tufa aki a zizi reh. <verse eid="3JN 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="3JN 1:4" />Meh Johjoh veve kpeh mya nza ni sehreh la mara amya mboh ma a rya tohmoh nimeh a tufa aki a zizi reh.<verse eid="3JN 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="3JN 1:5" />Iza amya ata mya nza ni kira lisa yehlehleh nimeh awumu mboh nza ni lisa ma mgbiri ambohroh mboh amboh tufa mboh reh. Mboh nza ma a bu sehneh mboh na anzoh reh. <verse eid="3JN 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="3JN 1:6" />Mboh ma bleh tsifa ma ikpi anzoh ma mgbiri amboh tufa mboh ma ikpi kira anzoh na mareh. Shingi mboh dehreh nimeh hende amoh alindeh ma aki Nnoh. <verse eid="3JN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="3JN 1:7" />A bu tsifa isa Kristi ŋa kyangwri amboh areh nza ma kate reh. Ma a sohroh a sa shingi anyi na Amboh nza ma a bu Yahudawa mboh kpeh reh. <verse eid="3JN 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="3JN 1:8" />A zohhoh meh ti shingi atohngoh ambohroh ma atsi ndohmoh amboh ika wohroh la meh ti te ndohmoh ambohroh ma amoh nimeh zizi kanga.<verse eid="3JN 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="3JN 1:9" />Meh ŋa ameh amgbasho ma amboh tufa mboh, Diyotarifis nza ka a kira ta a bu ata jiji ŋoh reh neh, a leke ta sa tsifa ambohroh reh. <verse eid="3JN 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="3JN 1:10" />Nza meh ti ba, meh nati vuru tsifa huho ata Diyotarifis nza a hehndeh a lisa reh, a hende ahwra tsifa mboh a bleh ma ikpi ambohroh. Wohroh a sohroh a tswa ŋoh kpeh, a leke ta sa atsi mboh Amboh tufa. A ha amboh ata nza ma a kira mata sa mboh tasa a katsi mboh a kate nimeh ida Nnoh.<verse eid="3JN 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="3JN 1:11" />Iza ata mya nza ni kira, kama tufa nnoh andromboh ata nza a bu abibi kpeh neh tufa nnoh ata nza a bu alindeh. Akyo ata nza a lisa andromboh ata nza a zohhoh anyi na Nnoh. Ata nza a lisa andromboh ata nza a bu agugu a wina Nnoh kpeh.<verse eid="3JN 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="3JN 1:12" />Kyangwri mboh nambri ma atsifa alindeh ma ikpi Dimitiriyus, tasa zizi za atsifa alindeh ma ikpi a ŋoh. Mbohroh za meh tsifa alindeh ma ikpi a ŋoh, tasa ni wina noh la tsifa ambohroh a bu zizi.<verse eid="3JN 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abitrusu Atsifa Ata Trina Ŋoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="3JN 1:13" />Meh bu na awumu akroh ŋa ba nnoh gaga dehreh neh, meh sohroh kira meh ti ŋa ma amgbasho ata areh kpeh. <verse eid="3JN 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="3JN 1:14" />Meh Gya agohsoh meh ti nza noh a nati a yanda kpeh, tasa meh nati tsifa mbohroh ma anzoh.<verse eid="3JN 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="3JN 1:15" />Ta tuma alindeh ta a bu na anzoh. Iziza anzoh mboh ma mareh ma atsifa na anzoh. Ti tsifa meh na iza ambohroh mboh reh ma asaa.<verse eid="3JN 1:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="3JN 1" />
</usx>